# Extra non-Tailscale VPN bypass routes
#
# Copy this file to:
#   ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/doc-newbie/vpn-bypass-routes.conf
#
# Add only destinations that must use the ordinary non-VPN default route.
# tailscaled already manages Tailscale peer and accepted subnet routes; do not
# duplicate those routes here. Hostnames and bare IP addresses are not allowed.
# Use /32 for one IPv4 address and /128 for one IPv6 address.
#
# Documentation-only examples (replace or remove before applying):
198.51.100.42/32
203.0.113.0/24
2001:db8:100::/48
2001:db8:200::42/128
